<title>USA: Thai Capital elects acting president.</title>
<headline>Thai Capital elects acting president.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Capital Fund Inc said Friday that chairman Suichi Komori has been elected acting president of the fund.</p>
<p>He succeeds Udom Vichayabhai, who retired as the fund's president and director earlier this year.</p>
<p>The fund said a president will be elected at the next board meeting, which is scheduled to be held on or about March 3.</p>
</text>
